This directory contains the CangHui Cangjie SDL3/SDL3_ttf wrapper and its
bundled Windows runtime DLLs. SDL3 and SDL3_ttf are distributed under the
zlib license reproduced above. Upstream provenance details are recorded in
`UPSTREAM.md`; where a bundled binary's exact source revision is not yet
verified, that fact is stated there instead of being assumed.
